11 September 2026 -&nbsp;On 13 August, UN DESA brought together young leaders, practitioners and policymakers for the 10th Youth Forum on SDG Implementation. Taking place online after the International Youth Day on 12 August, the Forum was organized under the theme “Advancing Youth Engagement in the Public Decision-Making Process through Digital Transformation and Innovative Governance”.

